  "limits": [
    "No native/Chromium/PGlite/live Postgres execution, source mutation, compiler/build, product/test module import, provider request, DB connection or environment-value/file inspection. Only static TypeScript parser library loaded.",
    "Full eight test files including every fixture/table/helper and all nine nested bodies; full five Ads owner modules, browser consent/funnel support, three actual migrations, live provider/route/adapter and billing outbox/type owners.",
    "Checkout, middleware/reconcile, package registry and previously audited billing test siblings are operative slices only. No new whole billing/Stripe/PayPal semantic credit or transitive all-import closure.",
    "Actual installed Playwright routing/fulfill, esbuild output transport/types, Node crypto types, PostgREST rpc source and PGlite query/exec types inspected. Native engines, browser executable, ICU currency tables, SQL engine internals, full Supabase/Auth/Next dependency closure and remote OpenAI SDK were not audited.",
    "Browser SDK and context API are locally implemented stubs; the real browser helper/consent code is bundled. Live Postgres uses a disposable database with synthetic predecessor tables and actual migrations, not a production schema copy. Optional invocation gates remain.",
    "No D because supported pending activation is documented and current production callers exist. Historical production/migration/verification claims in commit6364b47e are history only and were not reverified remotely.",
    "No C means no intended-fault run or control recipe is needed/proposed. Held F fixes require separate authorization/scope, including new inputs/observations; no repairs included.",
    "Every before/transfer/cut file is identical. This is a no-cut receipt, not deletion credit. Root current607/coverage status is parent-owned and unchanged."
  ],
